ia_topaz_upscale", "label": "Topaz upscale (~30 credits, only after approval)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L45", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_17_esfera_metodologia_sphere_fisheye_scene_py", "label": "tools/sphere_fisheye_scene.py compositor", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L48-51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Maps fisheye onto front/back halves (trim 0.985), adds title lockup, KV plate light band and chrome puma."}, {"id": "docs_17_esfera_metodologia_kv_light_band", "label": "KV plate light band (beam)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rising to the right, spark kept off the side joins."}, {"id": "docs_17_esfera_metodologia_chrome_puma", "label": "Chrome puma run loop on the beam", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_17_esfera_metodologia_never_loop_directional_clip", "label": "Never loop a clip that has a direction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L52", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The truck jumped back when looped; play once, change speed in post."}, {"id": "docs_17_esfera_metodologia_sphere_turntable_py", "label": "tools/sphere_turntable.py client preview", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/17_Esfera_metodologia.md", "source_location": "L53", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TURN=20 s per turn from audience height; not longe